  ${C_DIM}each group keeps its colour in every table${C_0}

${C_B}EXAMPLES${C_0}
  $PROG dash                  the live dashboard - watch RAM move, kill from it
  $PROG doctor                why the box died at 3am (memory cap, disk, 9P)
  $PROG swap                  who is paged out - the real cause of slowness
  $PROG projects              which checkout is costing you, not which process
  $PROG idle                  the dev servers you forgot about, and the orphans
  $PROG port 3111             which project is this, and where does it live
  $PROG kill port 3000        stop that Next dev server cleanly
  $PROG kill group mcp -d     preview reaping every stray MCP process
